  "description": "SILMEI crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C152 H120 Gd4 N12 O16,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd1B (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2B (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.599-3.883 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.54-111.28°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd4(μ3-OH)2L6(acac)4]·2CH3CN (C156H126Gd4N14O16). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
